          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka wokuqala kaKoresi, inkosi yasePheresiya, ukuze kugcwaliseke izwi likaJehova elakhulunywa ngomlomo kaJeremiya, uJehova wavusa umoya kaKoresi inkosi yasePheresiya ukuba enze ithempeli. Isimemezelo embusweni wakhe wonke, futhi wasibhala, wathi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
