          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usho kanje uKoresi, inkosi yasePheresiya, uthi: “Imibuso yonke yomhlaba iphiwe mina nguJehova uNkulunkulu wezulu; wangiyala ukuba ngimakhele indlu eJerusalema lakwaJuda. Ngubani phakathi kwenu kubo bonke abantu bakhe? UJehova uNkulunkulu wakhe makabe naye, akhuphuke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
          }
